              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
            },
            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Upgraded to 1.0 and adjusted the exclusion rules form JCR-2885 accordingly. With these exclusions we still keep the following dependencies:\n\n    PDF: pdfbox, fontbox, jempbox, bcmail, bcprov \n    MS Office: poi, poi-ooxml, poi-ooxml-schemas, poi-scratchpad, commons-codec, xmlbeans, dom4j, geronimo-stax-api\n    HTML: tagsoup \n\nBasic formats like plain text, XML and RTF (plus rudimentary support for OpenOffice) are handled with the standard Java class library.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
